CEXIT在pSyncPIM SpMV kernel中的调度流程：

```
// PIM kernel loading (AB mode): host broadcasts 32 instructions to all 256 PE control registers
// Instruction slot example (max 32 instructions):
//   [0] DMOV  SpVQ0 ← Bank[row_addr]    // Load first batch
//   [1] JUMP  label_loop, ORDER=0, CNT   // Enter loop with counter
//   [2] label_loop:
//   [3] IndMOV SRF ← Bank[SpVQ0.col]    // Predicated
//   [4] SSpV  SpVQ1 ← SRF ⊗ SpVQ0      // Predicated
//   [5] SpVDV DRF0 ← SpVQ1 ⊕ Bank       // Predicated
//   [6] DMOV  Bank ← DRF0               // Write partial result
//   [7] DMOV  SpVQ0 ← Bank[next_addr]   // Read next batch
//   [8] CEXIT SpVQ0                      // Exit when SpVQ0 empty
//   [9] JUMP  label_loop, ORDER=0, CNT-1 // Loop back if CNT>0

// Execution timeline (256 PEs, 假设3种workload size):
// t0: 所有PE执行instruction[0]→各自SpVQ0 loaded
// t1: 所有PE执行instructions[1..7]→处理一个batch
// t8: PE执行CEXIT instruction[8]:
//     - PE_0 (workload=3 batch, SpVQ0非空) → CEXIT不起作用, 继续
//     - PE_1 (workload=5 batch, SpVQ0非空) → CEXIT不起作用, 继续
//     - PE_2 (workload=0, SpVQ0空[pos=-1]) → CEXIT生效, PE_2 flag退出循环
// t9: PE_0和PE_1执行JUMP instruction[9]→循环; PE_2 idle (不改变memory数据)
// ... repeat until all PEs exit ...
// Host detects all-CEXIT → switch to SB mode → read results
```

