// PE_1 (workload=5 batch): ... → CEXIT not triggered → JUMP → continue  
// PE_2 (workload=0, all -1): ... → CEXIT triggered → PE_2 idle
// ... PE_0 exits at cycle T₁₀₀ → PE_1 continues ...
