Matrix Compaction（矩阵压缩）是pSyncPIM提出的稀疏矩阵预分配策略，用于在all-bank PIM架构下最小化external I/O traffic和bank间workload imbalance。核心操作：(1) row-wise partitioning——将稀疏矩阵按行等分成N份（N=bank数）；(2) all-zero column removal——对每份子矩阵移除全零列（compact），仅保留含non-zero的列；(3) distribution——将压缩子矩阵分发到各bank；(4) sentinel padding——用-1填充各bank的空白index queue位置，使所有bank消耗相同memory row数。子矩阵尺寸限制≤1KB（HBM2单memory row大小），确保input/output vector fits in one memory row per bank——避免cross-row access和remote bank access。

从kernel调度角度拆解术语，比如术语所在kernel调度的伪代码或具体计算过程，给出具体例子。通过联网搜索让回答具体和精准。
SpMV External I/O reduction流程：

```
// Host-side preprocessing (offline):
原始稀疏矩阵 A (n×n, NNZ non-zeros):
  Row-wise partition → [A₀ | A₁ | ... | A₂₅₅] (256 banks)
  For each Aᵢ:
      Scan all non-zeros in Aᵢ → record used column set Cᵢ
      Remove columns j where j ∉ Cᵢ (all-zero in Aᵢ)
      Build compact column index map: old_col → new_compact_col
      Generate compressed Aᵢ' (size ≤ 1KB in both dims)
      Pad non-zero row ends with -1 sentinels

// Naive distribution external I/O:
// Aᵢ稀疏分布在100个columns → external read 100个x[j] → 100 memory row accesses
// Compact distribution:
// Aᵢ' compressed columns ≤ 1KB/8B = 128 (FP64) → all x vector fits in ≤1 row
// → 1 external read per bank for input vector

// Host-side accumulation (after PIM execution):
for each bank b:
    read partial_out[b] from bank b
    for each non-zero output entry y[j]:
        global_y[j] += partial_out[b][j]
// Only non-zero entries require external writes
```

